    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Thinly slice steak against the grain.",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "To serve, arrange a bed of spinach on a plate and top with steak slices and strawberries. Sprinkle with almonds and enjoy!",
